				Time="2011-07-20T07:02:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　ぼくの　友達さ！
友情の　一撃を　くらえっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-25T09:07:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
