				Time="2011-07-20T07:16:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>全力を　出し合って
正々堂々　戦おう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-26T05:34:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
