	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WCS03M_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ただ　つよさのみを　しんじて
どこまで　かれは　つきすすむのかァ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:30:56" />
