				Time="2011-07-20T07:34:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ただ　強さのみを　信じて
どこまで　彼は　突き進むのかァ！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:31:42" />
