				Time="2011-07-20T07:40:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うおおおっ！　燃えてきた！
燃え尽きるまで　やろう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-27T08:36:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
